==== JTAG ====
At scan chain, found two devices in chain, no succes to read-write something from-to flash.
The TRST need to be putted high to enable chain.

How to connect to the Jtag test points of this specific device:

''tp12 SRST
tp11 TCK
tp10 TMS
tp7  TDO
tp6  TDI
tp4  TRST
''


